points radially outward and expands the gas
(<m>\nabla\cdot\mathbf{F} = 3</m>). Right: the field
<m>-y\,\mathbf{i} + x\,\mathbf{j}</m> rotates about the
<m>z</m>-axis without expansion (<m>\nabla\cdot\mathbf{F} = 0</m>).
</caption>
